    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Backmooms&quot; is a first-person adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857770/extras/c7c4e534b34ed586d52e903e95809a6e.avif?t=1753082053\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while out shopping, you suddenly find yourself lost in a strange and unfamiliar space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wander through the same yellow rooms over and over\u2014rooms that somehow feel familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, a mysterious monster begins to chase you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must find a way to escape this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857770/extras/cdf31560ad562bb01ff491e0de2a69df.avif?t=1753082053\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A walking simulator where events occur as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Progress the story by examining various objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    There is no text within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    This game was inspired by the internet meme &quot;Backrooms.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u201cShe\u201d sleeps as part of her job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s a monster here that wants to become a \u201cmother.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 15 to 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Video Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Both individuals and organizations may stream the game without needing prior permission.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Backmooms&quot; is a first-person adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857770/extras/c7c4e534b34ed586d52e903e95809a6e.avif?t=1753082053\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, while out shopping, you suddenly find yourself lost in a strange and unfamiliar space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wander through the same yellow rooms over and over\u2014rooms that somehow feel familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then, a mysterious monster begins to chase you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must find a way to escape this place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857770/extras/cdf31560ad562bb01ff491e0de2a69df.avif?t=1753082053\" width=616 height=158 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    A walking simulator where events occur as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Progress the story by examining various objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    There is no text within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    This game was inspired by the internet meme &quot;Backrooms.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u201cShe\u201d sleeps as part of her job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s a monster here that wants to become a \u201cmother.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated playtime: 15 to 60 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Video Streaming Guidelines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Both individuals and organizations may stream the game without needing prior permission.</p>",
    "short_description": "You\u2019ve wandered into a strange dimension while shopping.A mysterious monster is chasing you.You must escape.&quot;Backmooms&quot; is a first-person adventure game.",
